<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: A New Mission">
<p>When you regain control of Stocke, you&#x27;ll be outside the tavern.  Climb the stairs to the left and talk to the man all the way at the bottom.  His name is Cedric and he will give you the [A Letter to Tomorrow] sidequest.  Now that the road is fixed, you have access to the left upper level of the First Ward below. Open the two chests there which contain a SEED RING (HP+10/MP+5, sell) and 1500 G.  Now, head back up to the castle.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Talk to the receptionist to the left to receive the [Engineer Recruit] sidequest.  In the lower right of the first floor is a woman tending to the flowers.  Talk to her to receive the [A Flower of Promise] sidequest.  Above her are two rooms.  Enter the left room and talk to the blue soldier who wasn&#x27;t there before to receive the [Raynie the Active] &amp; [Marco the Calm] sidequests. If you completed the Accident in the Cave sidequest, then talk to him again and choose &quot;Teach it to Marco&quot; to use the Right-Cut Scroll, so he can learn Right Assault for himself.</p>

<p>Leave and enter the door to the right.  Before talking to Sonja in the infirmary, enter the Laboratory to the left.  Talk to the woman there named Meese to receive the [Red-Letter Day] sidequest.  Now go to the infirmary in the room to the right and talk to Sonja.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Summoned by Raul">
<p>Head back downstairs and talk to Sonja to advance the [Red-Letter Day] sidequest.  Now&#x27;s as good a time as any to jump around time.  Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node and talk to Rosch on the first floor.  Choosing to &quot;Chase after&quot; Sonja will unlock [A Knight&#x27;s End] ending.  Otherwise, choosing to &quot;Send Rosch&quot; will advance the [Red-Letter Day] sidequest.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Before turning in the sidequest, return to &quot;The Closed Mine&quot; node.  Enter the house and talk to the engineer, Berman, to advance the [Engineer Recuit] sidequest.  Return to the [A New Mission node].  Remember, you can press start to skip all the cutscenes.</p>

<p>Return to the receptionist at the castle to complete the [Engineer Recruit] sidequest and receive 3000 G.  Then, head downstairs and talk to Meese at the laboratory to complete the [Red-Letter Day] sidequest and receive the P.Thauma Spear (ATK+23/DEF+2, equip on Rosch).  Continue the plot as before, then take the elevator up to the third floor and talk to Lt. General Raul at his office on the right.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Through Lazvil">
<p>Afterwards, leave Alistel and head south to Lazvil Hills.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Rune Edge, Silver Mail, Fang Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Rune Spear, Silver Mail, Horn Charm x3<br/>Marco: Alistel Edge, Heavy Mail, Pawn Stud x3<br/>Rosch: P.Thauma Spear, Silver Mail, Fang Charm x3</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
