<p>There&#x27;s no new treasure to find, so just head straight to your destinations. Head west and you&#x27;ll find that the bridge has been fixed.  If you continue west you&#x27;ll find that you can&#x27;t go to Alma Mine in this time period, so just go south to the Woodland Path.  If you headed south from the Highway, then go west to the Woodland Path.  In either case, proceed west to the rendezvous point.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Heiss&#x27; Intentions">
