    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
<p>No new treasure here, unless you haven&#x27;t been through here in Standard History yet.  If not, refer to section JUDG1.  As before, the enemies to the west are very powerful, so just head north two screens to find the spy.</p>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Shadow WEAKNESS: None STRATEGY: He&#x27;ll start with Heal Zone.  Whenever an enemy uses something like that, immediately get them off of it.  Marco should use Magic Boost on Raynie, followed by a spell and Stocke pushing Shadow into the back row.  Then, use Magic Boost on Stocke, and wail on him with spells to finish him off. *******************************************************************************</p>

<p>[Reporting to Viola] After discussing recent events, you can head to the Sand Fortress.</p>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
