  <!-- Chapter 19 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch19"
    number={19}
    title="Granorg (Standard Chapter 2)"
    code="GRNG2"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="22"
      party="Stocke, Raynie, Marco"
      
      
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Duty Revealed">
<p>After receiving your mission, head west to Main Street, and south to the guard by the save point.  Talk to him twice to receive the [Mankind &amp; Beastkind] sidequest.  Go west to the inn, upstairs, and into the right room.  Talk to the man there, whose name is Kaizan, to receive the [One &amp; Only] sidequest. Leave the inn, walk around its left side, and up the stairs to the west to find Liese.  Talk to her to advance the [Mankind &amp; Beastkind] sidequest.  Return to the guard who gave you the sidequest to advance it again.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Head west two screens to the Back Alley, where you will run into some old friends who disappear.  Enter the tavern, and talk to the bartender to get some information on where they might have gone.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Castle Sewers">
<p>You could proceed with the plot, but I think this is a good time to do sidequests and collect some new treasure with our Mana Sight ability.  If you really want to just continue with the plot, then skip to UGWW.  Return to &quot;The Closed Mine&quot; node.  Enter the house and talk to the miner to advance the [One &amp; Only] sidequest.  Search around the house with Mana Sight to reveal a chest which contains the IMPALE CORE for Rosch later.  If you climb the ramp to the right of the house, you can now find a hidden chest which contains 2 MANA CRYSTALS.  Now, return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node and choose to Join the Rosch Brigade.</p>
</Callout>

