<p>Start by searching Hugo&#x27;s office for a hidden chest which contains 2000 G.  In Raul&#x27;s office on the right is a hidden chest which contains a PANACEA PLUS. Take the elevator down to the second floor, and search Viola&#x27;s office on the left for a hidden chest which contains a SHIELD SEED.  Search Heiss&#x27; office on the right for a hidden chest which contains the RHAPSODY (ATK+12/MAG+18/SPD+5), which you should save for Aht later.  Leave the castle.</p>

<p>Climb the stairs on the right side of the second ward, and the next set too. On the upper platform to the left is a hidden chest which contains 2000 G. Head down to the first ward, and search the alley behind the item shop for a hidden chest which contains the FIRE PACT for Stocke later.  Go up the stairs on the right, and search left on the upper platform for a hidden chest which contains 2 MANA CRYSTALS.</p>

<p>On the second floor of the inn, you can find Kaizan.  Talk to him to advance the [One &amp; Only] sidequest.  If you go to the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node, you could also access the upper platform on the left side of the First Ward and find a hidden chest which contains 2000 G.  Instead, I would stay here and go to Lazvil Hills.</p>

<p>Highway W               Highway         Highway E</p>

<p>___                     | |            __________________   ___/6  \_ ____________   __/   \           X____________    __   ___     _X ______   __   _      |                  |   _____/        \___/  |    ____/      |     |                   \  __|           |   |   \  |            \   /                   | |               \  |    | |             |X| Woodland          | |                | |    | |             | |  Path W    _____   _______| |               _| |    | |            _| |_  _|  S _   _ 4 _   _|              |   |   /  | Woodland  |     | |     |_    \_/ | |    Woodland     \  |__|   |  Path E   |1| | |  Southern |     X5|      /   \____ Path        |_   ____|          _|/   \|_    Path  \_   /       /   S     \____   _______| |              |2__   _*_|    | |       /_______________   _________|                  |X|</p>

