1 - Healing Herb x2   2 - Rune Claw   3 - Herbal Tea x2   |      _____   Road
4 - Superior Tea      5 - Panacea     6 - Panacea x3      |_3___|</pre>
</AsciiMap>

<p>Use the barrel on the right to blow up the rocks below you to access the Southern Path.  Cut through the tall grass on the left to reach a chest which contains 2 HEALING HERBS.  Go down the middle path and search the left side for a hidden chest which contains a RUNE CLAW (ATK+41/MDF+5) that you should save for later.  There is a hidden barrel on the right that you can use to blow up the rocks below.  At the bottom of the Seaside Road is a chest which contains 2 HERBAL TEAS.</p>

<p>Return to the entrance at Highway East, head west one screen, south one, and west one.  Definitely use the save point before going near the huge monster.</p>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Giant Boar WEAKNESS: Fire STRATEGY: He will start by casting Kiai Charge.  If you want to play it safe, use some Shield Herbs that you may have won from enemies earlier.  Usually, he will spend his second turn also using Kiai Charge.  In any case, you want to string together 8-9 consecutive turns using either Change or your new Mana Burst: Turn Break.  Simply use it to select the enemy&#x27;s turn to delete it and without sacrificing your own turn!  Once you have done that, use Magic Boost on Stocke and Raynie, then use six Fire spells to defeat him. *******************************************************************************</p>

<p>For defeating the Giant Boar, you will win the SAVORY BOAR MEAT and advance [The Ultimate Dish] sidequest.  Go north and west at the fork.  Search the upper wall for a hidden chest which contains a SUPERIOR TEA.  Proceed west to the next area, and cut through the tall grass on the right side to find a chest which contains a PANACEA.  Go back to the fork, head north and east one screen. Cut through the tall grass above to find a chest which contains 3 PANACEAS.</p>

<p>Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node and talk to Kaizan at the inn to advance the [One &amp; Only] sidequest.  Talk to Kaizan back at Alistel again to advance the [One &amp; Only] sidequest.  Finally, talk to Kaizan at Granorg to complete the [One &amp; Only] sidequest and receive the FIRESTAR PACT for Aht later.  By the way, do NOT talk to Hilster about The Ultimate Dish sidequest yet or you will lose your Savory Boar Meat and have to start over.</p>

<p>Rest up at the inn and return to the tavern.  Search behind it to find the secret passage that leads to the palace.</p>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
