<p>Finally, from the open area, take the left path on the lower side.  Go left at the fork to a chest which contains a MAIL VEST (DEF+22/MDF+17, equip on Stocke) but save his Heavy Mail for Rosch.  Walk down from the fork and left to a chest which contains 2000 G.  Head right to find a girl named Claire, who you should escort out of here, eventually.  You can skip this for now to get some optional scenes, but eventually, you will have to do this, which will unlock the [Escort] node to receive the SMALL SATCHEL and HOLY WATER. On the two paths on the right are two chests which contain a WIND ARMLET (SPD+3, save for later) and 2 PANACEAS.  Now, escort Claire out of the dungeon, rest up at the inn, and get ready for a trip to the end.</p>

<p>From the entrance, go up one screen and right two screens.  Go up the right path on the upper side to a chest which contains 2 MANA CRYSTALS.  Then, head up the left path to a chest which contains a MEDICLOTH.  Continue up, left, and up one screen to another open area.  Pull the lever (Kronk) to lower the drawbridges and take the lower path on the right to a chest which contains 2000 G.  Head right along the upper path on the right side to a ladder which leads inside the Granorg Palace.</p>

<p>Go left to the Underground Passage, where you will be prompted for a decision. Choosing &quot;I&#x27;ll be the decoy&quot; will unlock the [Fated Assassination] ending.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: How to Disappear">
<p>Return to this node and advance the plot up to the same decision.  However, choose to &quot;Stick to stealth&quot; will only lead to a dead end.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: High Alert">
<p>If you have already resolved this roadblock, then skip to GPLC1.  Otherwise, you will need to return to &quot;The Valkyrie&quot; node in Alternate History to put the Mana Sight ability to use at the Sand Fortress.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Rune Edge, Mail Vest, Fang Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Rune Spear, Heavy Mail, Horn Charm x3<br/>Marco: Wisp Blade, Heavy Mail, Bishop Stud, Knight Stud x2<br/>Extra: Rhapsody, Rune Claw, Heavy Mail, Wind Armlet</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
